6
00:00:09,033 --> 00:00:10,233
灯已经关了
the lights are already off

7
00:00:10,366 --> 00:00:11,666
手机还亮着
but the phone is still glowing

8
00:00:11,933 --> 00:00:13,233
手指往下一滑
Your finger swipes down

9
00:00:13,433 --> 00:00:15,666
一个东西突然变得特别需要
and something suddenly feels like a must have

10
00:00:15,966 --> 00:00:17,666
白天你明明没想买
During the day you had no urge to buy it

11
00:00:17,866 --> 00:00:18,833
到了深夜
but late at night

12
00:00:18,966 --> 00:00:20,366
它就像在对你说
it seems to whisper to you

13
00:00:20,633 --> 00:00:21,433
买吧
just buy it

14
00:00:21,833 --> 00:00:23,600
你今天已经够累了
you have had a hard enough day

15
00:00:23,833 --> 00:00:26,633
很多人以为深夜下单是自控力差
Many think late night shopping is weak willpower

16
00:00:26,866 --> 00:00:27,966
我觉得不是
I do not think so

17
00:00:28,266 --> 00:00:30,966
深夜下单最反直觉的地方在于
The most counterintuitive part of it is this

18
00:00:31,133 --> 00:00:32,766
你买的往往不是东西
what you buy is often not the thing itself

19
00:00:33,233 --> 00:00:35,300
而是对白天那口气的补偿
but compensation for what you swallowed all day

20
00:00:35,733 --> 00:00:37,233
白天你忍了太多
During the day you held back too much

21
00:00:37,533 --> 00:00:38,900
忍领导的语气
endured your boss's tone

22
00:00:39,166 --> 00:00:40,600
忍客户的要求
endured the client's demands

23
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:42,433
忍地铁里的拥挤
endured the crowded subway

24
00:00:42,733 --> 00:00:44,833
忍自己不敢说出口的不爽
endured the frustration you never dared to voice

25
00:00:44,966 --> 00:00:45,966
到了晚上
and when night comes

26
00:00:46,066 --> 00:00:48,033
你终于可以点一下付款
you can finally tap that pay button

27
00:00:48,233 --> 00:00:49,400
那一下很轻
the tap is light

28
00:00:49,533 --> 00:00:51,166
但它像是在告诉自己
but it feels like telling yourself

29
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:53,066
至少这件事我说了算
at least this one thing is mine to decide

30
00:00:53,433 --> 00:00:55,600
这条视频不劝你戒购物
This video will not tell you to quit shopping

31
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:57,833
也不站在高处批评消费
nor lecture you from above about spending

32
00:00:57,933 --> 00:01:00,866
只讲一个普通人每天都在经历的判断
it is about a choice ordinary people face every day

33
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:03,466
很多冲动消费不是欲望太强
Most impulse buys are not about strong desire

34
00:01:03,566 --> 00:01:05,600
而是白天的委屈没有出口
but daytime grievances with no way out

35
00:01:05,833 --> 00:01:07,066
晚上十二点
It is midnight

36
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:08,566
你终于躺下
you finally lie down

37
00:01:08,833 --> 00:01:11,166
一天里所有人都不找你了
and no one needs you anymore today

38
00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:12,800
工作群安静了
the work chat has gone quiet

39
00:01:12,900 --> 00:01:14,166
家里人睡了
your family is asleep

40
00:01:14,266 --> 00:01:16,233
房间里只剩你和手机
only you and your phone are left in the room

41
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:17,900
这一刻很危险
This moment is dangerous

42
00:01:18,066 --> 00:01:19,666
因为你会突然觉得
because you suddenly feel

43
00:01:19,766 --> 00:01:22,066
我终于有一点自己的时间了
I finally have a little time to myself

44
00:01:22,166 --> 00:01:23,966
白天你像一台机器
During the day you are like a machine

45
00:01:24,133 --> 00:01:26,033
该回消息就回消息
reply to messages when you should

46
00:01:26,233 --> 00:01:27,666
该开会就开会
attend meetings when you should

47
00:01:27,866 --> 00:01:28,966
该笑就笑
smile when you should

48
00:01:29,066 --> 00:01:30,066
该忍就忍
endure when you should

49
00:01:30,166 --> 00:01:31,266
可到了深夜
but late at night

50
00:01:31,333 --> 00:01:32,833
你不用再扮演谁
you no longer have to play any role

51
00:01:32,933 --> 00:01:34,766
你想刷什么就刷什么
you scroll whatever you want

52
00:01:34,766 --> 00:01:36,400
想买什么就买什么
you buy whatever you want

53
00:01:36,466 --> 00:01:39,200
这就是深夜购物最会抓人的地方
This is what makes late night shopping so gripping

54
00:01:39,333 --> 00:01:41,366
它把消费包装成自由
it dresses spending up as freedom

55
00:01:41,633 --> 00:01:43,300
你不是在买一个杯子
