你是在买一种我还可以选择的感觉
you are buying the feeling that you can still choose

57
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:48,233
你不是在买一件衣服
You are not buying a piece of clothing

58
00:01:48,300 --> 00:01:51,433
你是在买一个明天会不会更像样的自己
you are buying a more put together version of tomorrow

59
00:01:51,866 --> 00:01:53,600
你不是在买一份零食
You are not buying a snack

60
00:01:53,833 --> 00:01:56,966
你是在安慰那个白天没被好好照顾的人
you are comforting the one who went uncared for all day

61
00:01:57,233 --> 00:01:59,066
如果你白天过得很顺
If your day went smoothly

62
00:01:59,266 --> 00:02:01,400
晚上可能刷两下就睡了
you probably scroll a bit and fall asleep

63
00:02:01,533 --> 00:02:03,766
但如果你白天一直被压着
but if you were pressed down all day

64
00:02:03,933 --> 00:02:05,366
晚上那一点点购买权
that little bit of buying power at night

65
00:02:05,366 --> 00:02:05,933
就会变得特别诱人
becomes especially tempting

66
00:02:05,933 --> 00:02:06,566
因为在一天的大部分时间里
because for most of the day

67
00:02:06,566 --> 00:02:07,100
你都在满足别人的要求
you were meeting other people's demands

68
00:02:07,100 --> 00:02:07,866
只有下单那一刻
only at the moment of ordering

69
00:02:07,866 --> 00:02:08,700
世界好像终于按你的意思动了一下
does the world finally move the way you want

70
00:02:08,700 --> 00:02:09,466
这就是很多人控制不住的原因
This is why so many cannot hold back

71
00:02:09,466 --> 00:02:09,866
不是东西太好
it is not that the thing is so good

72
00:02:09,866 --> 00:02:10,366
而是那一下决定权太甜
but that the moment of control is so sweet

73
00:02:10,366 --> 00:02:10,833
人最容易为自由感买单
People most easily pay for a sense of freedom

74
00:02:10,833 --> 00:02:11,533
哪怕那种自由只持续到付款成功
even if it lasts only until the payment goes through

75
00:02:11,533 --> 00:02:12,033
还有一个更现实的原因
There is also a more practical reason

76
00:02:12,033 --> 00:02:12,533
白天的大脑太累了
your brain is exhausted by daytime

77
00:02:12,533 --> 00:02:12,900
早上选穿什么
choosing what to wear in the morning

78
00:02:12,900 --> 00:02:13,300
路上回谁的消息
deciding whose messages to answer on the way

79
00:02:13,300 --> 00:02:13,766
上班判断哪件事先做
figuring out what to do first at work

80
00:02:13,766 --> 00:02:14,500
开会听别人说话
listening to others in meetings

81
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:15,066
下班还要想吃什么
and deciding what to eat after work

82
00:02:15,066 --> 00:02:15,300
一天到晚
all day long

83
00:02:15,300 --> 00:02:15,900
你的脑子都在做小决定
your brain keeps making small decisions

84
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:16,633
这些决定单独看不大
each one seems minor on its own

85
00:02:16,633 --> 00:02:17,466
但它们会一点一点耗掉你的耐心
but together they slowly drain your patience

86
00:02:17,466 --> 00:02:17,800
到了深夜
and by late night

87
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:18,233
你已经不想再比较
you no longer want to compare

88
00:02:18,233 --> 00:02:18,766
不想再算值不值
no longer want to weigh if it is worth it

89
00:02:18,766 --> 00:02:19,433
不想再问自己是不是真的需要
no longer want to ask if you really need it

90
00:02:19,433 --> 00:02:20,033
你只想让某件事快点结束
you just want something to be over quickly

91
00:02:20,033 --> 00:02:20,833
于是平台最喜欢这个时刻
so the platforms love this moment

92
00:02:20,833 --> 00:02:21,133
限时优惠
limited time offer

93
00:02:21,133 --> 00:02:21,433
今晚结束
ends tonight

94
00:02:21,433 --> 00:02:21,666
库存不多
low in stock

95
00:02:21,666 --> 00:02:22,066
猜你喜欢
picked for you

96
00:02:22,066 --> 00:02:22,500
别人也买了
others bought it too

97
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:23,166
这些词白天看起来普通
these words look ordinary by day

98
00:02:23,166 --> 00:02:24,033
到了深夜就会变得很有力量
but turn powerful late at night

99
00:02:24,033 --> 00:02:24,566
因为你累了
because you are tired

100
00:02:24,566 --> 00:02:25,100
累的人不喜欢复杂
tired people dislike complexity

101
00:02:25,100 --> 00:02:25,600
累的人喜欢被推着走
tired people like to be pushed along

102
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:26,066
你可能也有过这种体验
You may have felt this too

103
00:02:26,066 --> 00:02:26,500
白天买东西
when buying by day

104
00:02:26,500 --> 00:02:26,933
你会看评价
you check reviews

105
00:02:26,933 --> 00:02:27,166
比价格
compare prices

106
00:02:27,166 --> 00:02:27,433
问朋友
ask friends

107
00:02:27,433 --> 00:02:27,900
甚至放进购物车冷一冷
even leave it in the cart to cool off

108
00:02:27,900 --> 00:02:28,300
但深夜买东西
but buying late at night

109
00:02:28,300 --> 00:02:28,666
常常是看见
is often just see it

110
00:02:28,666 --> 00:02:28,866
心动
want it

111
00:02:28,866 --> 00:02:29,233
付款
pay

112
00:02:29,233 --> 00:02:29,766
然后第二天醒来
and then you wake up the next day

113
00:02:29,766 --> 00:02:30,233
看着订单发呆
staring blankly at the order

114
00:02:30,233 --> 00:02:30,666
我昨晚为什么买这个
why did I buy this last night

115
00:02:30,666 --> 00:02:31,166
这不是因为你突然变笨
It is not that you suddenly got dumb

116
00:02:31,166 --> 00:02:31,766
是因为白天那个负责刹车的你
it is that the part of you that hits the brakes

117
00:02:31,766 --> 00:02:32,100
晚上已经很累了
is already worn out by night

118
00:02:32,100 --> 00:02:32,633
很多商家卖的不是商品
Many sellers are not selling goods

119
00:02:32,633 --> 00:02:33,300
是你疲惫时最不想做判断的那几秒
but those few seconds when you are too tired to judge

120
00:02:33,300 --> 00:02:34,100
消费最会趁虚而入的时刻
The moment spending sneaks in

121
00:02:34,100 --> 00:02:34,566
不是你最快乐的时候
is not when you are happiest

122
00:02:34,566 --> 00:02:35,233
而是你最懒得反抗的时候
but when you are least willing to resist

123
00:02:35,233 --> 00:02:35,600
再往深一点看
Looking a little deeper

124
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:36,000
很多深夜订单
many late night orders

125
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:36,566
其实不是购物订单
are not really shopping orders

126
00:02:36,566 --> 00:02:37,166
是情绪订单
they are emotional orders

127
00:02:37,166 --> 00:02:38,766
你被领导说了几句
Your boss gives you a few harsh words

128
00:02:38,900 --> 00:02:40,833
晚上买一件贵一点的衣服
at night you buy a pricier piece of clothing

129
00:02:41,033 --> 00:02:42,633
不是因为衣柜空了
not because your closet is empty

130
00:02:42,700 --> 00:02:44,900
是因为你想证明自己没那么差
but because you want to prove you are not that bad

131
00:02:45,233 --> 00:02:47,233
你白天一直照顾别人情绪
You tend to everyone's feelings all day

132
00:02:47,466 --> 00:02:49,466
晚上点一顿高热量宵夜
at night you order a heavy late snack

133
00:02:49,666 --> 00:02:51,400
不是因为真的饿到不行
not because you are truly starving

134
00:02:51,933 --> 00:02:54,200
是因为你想让自己被照顾一次
but because you want to be cared for once

135
00:02:54,366 --> 00:02:56,300
你最近觉得生活没变化
Your life feels stuck lately

136
00:02:56,533 --> 00:02:58,066
晚上买一个新摆件
so at night you buy a new ornament

137
00:02:58,166 --> 00:02:59,666
不是因为家里缺它
not because your home needs it

138
00:02:59,966 --> 00:03:02,100
是因为你想制造一点新的开始
but because you want a little fresh start

139
00:03:02,333 --> 00:03:03,900
这些行为都能理解
All of this is understandable

140
00:03:04,033 --> 00:03:05,100
人不是账本
people are not account books

141
00:03:05,166 --> 00:03:06,300
人需要安慰
people need comfort

142
00:03:06,533 --> 00:03:07,466
问题在于
the problem is

143
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:09,500
如果每一次安慰都靠付款
if every comfort comes from paying

144
00:03:09,933 --> 00:03:12,833
你的情绪就会被训练成一个很贵的系统
your emotions get trained into a very costly system

145
00:03:13,033 --> 00:03:13,833
不开心
unhappy

146
00:03:13,833 --> 00:03:14,533
买
buy

147
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:15,333
焦虑
anxious

148
00:03:15,333 --> 00:03:15,966
买
buy

149
00:03:15,966 --> 00:03:16,633
孤独
lonely

150
00:03:16,633 --> 00:03:17,233
买
buy

151
00:03:17,233 --> 00:03:17,866
累了
tired

152
00:03:17,866 --> 00:03:18,500
买
buy

153
00:03:18,566 --> 00:03:19,533
时间久了
over time

154
00:03:19,533 --> 00:03:21,033
你会越来越难分清
it gets harder to tell apart

155
00:03:21,100 --> 00:03:22,666
我是真的需要这个东西
whether I really need this thing

156
00:03:22,933 --> 00:03:25,100
还是我只是需要一个人抱抱我
or I just need someone to hold me

157
00:03:25,300 --> 00:03:27,166
深夜购物最危险的地方
The real danger of late night shopping

158
00:03:27,233 --> 00:03:28,666
不是多花了一点钱
is not the extra money spent

159
00:03:28,933 --> 00:03:30,466
而是它让你误以为
but that it tricks you into believing

160
00:03:30,566 --> 00:03:33,200
所有坏情绪都可以靠快递解决
every bad mood can be solved by a delivery

161
00:03:33,366 --> 00:03:34,800
可快递到的那天
but on the day it arrives

162
00:03:34,900 --> 00:03:36,100
你拆开盒子
you open the box

163
00:03:36,166 --> 00:03:37,366
开心几分钟
happy for a few minutes

164
00:03:37,633 --> 00:03:39,766
然后生活还是原来的生活
and then life is still the same life

165
00:03:40,033 --> 00:03:41,633
工作还是那个工作
the job is still that job

166
00:03:41,866 --> 00:03:43,400
压力还是那个压力
the stress is still that stress

167
00:03:43,566 --> 00:03:44,700
东西留下了
the thing stays

168
00:03:44,766 --> 00:03:46,266
情绪没有被处理
the emotion goes unprocessed

169
00:03:46,333 --> 00:03:47,666
账单也留下了
and the bill stays too

170
00:03:47,733 --> 00:03:49,766
所以你会陷入一个循环
so you fall into a loop

171
00:03:50,100 --> 00:03:51,200
越累越买
the more tired the more you buy

172
00:03:51,433 --> 00:03:52,700
越买越心虚
the more you buy the more uneasy

173
00:03:52,933 --> 00:03:54,900
越心虚越想补偿自己
the more uneasy the more you want to make up for it

174
00:03:55,233 --> 00:03:57,666
最后你不是拥有了更多东西
in the end you do not own more things

175
00:03:58,033 --> 00:03:59,833
而是被更多东西提醒
you are reminded by more things

176
00:03:59,966 --> 00:04:01,800
我好像又没照顾好自己
that you failed to take care of yourself again

177
00:04:02,066 --> 00:04:03,666
真正需要警惕的
What truly deserves caution

178
00:04:03,666 --> 00:04:05,633
不是偶尔买点喜欢的东西
is not buying something you like once in a while

179
00:04:06,033 --> 00:04:09,000
而是你把消费当成唯一的情绪出口
but making spending your only emotional outlet

180
00:04:09,566 --> 00:04:10,833
出口太单一
when the outlet is too narrow

181
00:04:10,933 --> 00:04:12,466
人就会被它牵着走
people get dragged along by it

182
00:04:12,900 --> 00:04:14,100
