183
00:04:14,333 --> 00:04:17,966
深夜下单经常发生在你刚刷完短视频之后
Late night buying often follows scrolling short videos

184
00:04:18,466 --> 00:04:20,400
你看见别人换了新房间
You see someone redo their room

185
00:04:20,666 --> 00:04:21,833
别人用了新香薰
someone using a new scent

186
00:04:22,333 --> 00:04:24,033
别人穿着新衣服出门
someone heading out in new clothes

187
00:04:24,266 --> 00:04:26,200
别人把生活拍得很轻盈
someone filming life so light and easy

188
00:04:26,500 --> 00:04:27,766
你躺在床上看
you watch it lying in bed

189
00:04:27,933 --> 00:04:29,200
一边觉得好看
thinking it looks nice

190
00:04:29,366 --> 00:04:31,700
一边觉得自己的生活有点粗糙
while feeling your own life is a bit rough

191
00:04:31,966 --> 00:04:34,566
这种落差很容易变成购买冲动
That gap easily turns into an urge to buy

192
00:04:35,100 --> 00:04:37,033
你不是单纯想要那件东西
You do not simply want that item

193
00:04:37,433 --> 00:04:40,066
你是想买走自己和别人之间的差距
you want to buy away the gap between you and others

194
00:04:40,433 --> 00:04:41,466
可问题是
but the problem is

195
00:04:41,700 --> 00:04:43,366
别人展示的是结果
others show you the result

196
00:04:43,500 --> 00:04:44,900
你购买的是碎片
you are buying a fragment

197
00:04:45,266 --> 00:04:48,000
一个杯子不能让生活变成那条视频
A cup cannot turn your life into that video

198
00:04:48,333 --> 00:04:51,033
一盏灯不能替你处理混乱的作息
A lamp cannot fix your messy schedule

199
00:04:51,166 --> 00:04:54,433
一件衣服也不能直接把你变成更松弛的人
Clothes cannot make you a more relaxed person

200
00:04:54,833 --> 00:04:56,466
所以很多深夜订单
so many late night orders

201
00:04:56,633 --> 00:04:58,300
到手以后才会失效
only lose their magic once they arrive

202
00:04:58,566 --> 00:05:01,000
因为它承诺你的不是商品功能
because what they promised was not function

203
00:05:01,166 --> 00:05:02,833
而是一种生活幻觉
but an illusion of a life

204
00:05:03,133 --> 00:05:04,500
你以为买的是东西
You think you are buying a thing

205
00:05:04,900 --> 00:05:07,500
其实买的是我也可以那样的想象
but you buy the fantasy that you could live like that

206
00:05:07,866 --> 00:05:08,966
想象很美
the fantasy is beautiful

207
00:05:09,066 --> 00:05:11,033
但它很少包邮到现实
but it rarely ships free to reality

208
00:05:11,333 --> 00:05:13,233
这时候最该停下来的
What should stop here

209
00:05:13,300 --> 00:05:14,366
不是购物车
is not the cart

210
00:05:14,566 --> 00:05:17,766
而是那个一直拿自己和别人比较的脑子
but the mind that keeps comparing you to others

211
00:05:18,166 --> 00:05:20,000
如果你今天已经很累
If you are already exhausted today

212
00:05:20,233 --> 00:05:22,500
就别再让别人的精修生活
do not let other people's polished lives

213
00:05:22,633 --> 00:05:24,033
继续向你收费
keep charging you

214
00:05:24,566 --> 00:05:25,866
那普通人怎么办
So what should ordinary people do

215
00:05:26,233 --> 00:05:27,566
不是从此不买
not to never buy again

216
00:05:27,666 --> 00:05:29,800
也不是把自己管成苦行僧
nor to live like a monk

217
00:05:30,066 --> 00:05:32,433
而是把付款前的三秒钟拿回来
but to reclaim the three seconds before paying

218
00:05:32,633 --> 00:05:33,433
第一
First

219
00:05:33,433 --> 00:05:35,700
给深夜购物设一个白天复审
set a daytime review for late night buys

220
00:05:35,966 --> 00:05:36,966
晚上想买
if you want it at night

221
00:05:37,033 --> 00:05:38,600
可以先放进购物车
put it in the cart first

222
00:05:38,700 --> 00:05:40,066
但别马上付款
but do not pay right away

223
00:05:40,300 --> 00:05:41,100
告诉自己
tell yourself

224
00:05:41,333 --> 00:05:42,833
明天中午还想要
if I still want it tomorrow noon

225
00:05:42,833 --> 00:05:43,533
再买
then buy it

226
00:05:43,700 --> 00:05:45,166
这个方法很简单
This method is simple

227
00:05:45,166 --> 00:05:46,166
但很有效
but it works

228
00:05:46,466 --> 00:05:48,066
因为真正需要的东西
because what you truly need

229
00:05:48,100 --> 00:05:49,233
过一晚还在
is still there after a night

230
00:05:49,500 --> 00:05:51,266
靠情绪撑起来的欲望
desires propped up by emotion

231
00:05:51,300 --> 00:05:53,033
很多第二天就塌了
often collapse by the next day

232
00:05:53,100 --> 00:05:53,900
第二
Second

233
00:05:53,900 --> 00:05:55,233
付款前问一句
before paying ask yourself

234
00:05:55,300 --> 00:05:56,766
我现在缺的是东西
is it a thing I am short of

235
00:05:56,933 --> 00:05:58,000
还是休息
or is it rest

236
00:05:58,100 --> 00:06:00,266
有时候你需要的不是新衣服
sometimes what you need is not new clothes

237
00:06:00,300 --> 00:06:01,300
是早点睡
it is an early night

238
00:06:01,466 --> 00:06:02,633
不是新耳机
not new headphones

239
00:06:02,733 --> 00:06:04,566
是一个不被打扰的晚上
but an undisturbed evening

240
00:06:04,700 --> 00:06:06,000
不是一顿宵夜
not a late night meal

241
00:06:06,033 --> 00:06:07,766
是有人听你说几句话
but someone to hear you out

242
00:06:08,033 --> 00:06:11,566
这个问题会把你从商品页面拉回自己身上
This question pulls you from the product page back to yourself

243
00:06:11,833 --> 00:06:12,633
第三
Third

244
00:06:12,700 --> 00:06:14,866
给坏情绪准备便宜出口
prepare cheap outlets for bad moods

245
00:06:15,033 --> 00:06:16,400
比如洗个热水澡
like taking a hot shower

246
00:06:16,433 --> 00:06:17,766
出门走十分钟
walking outside for ten minutes

247
00:06:17,833 --> 00:06:18,800
写几句话
writing a few lines

248
00:06:18,833 --> 00:06:20,366
把房间收一小块
tidying a small corner of your room

249
00:06:20,466 --> 00:06:22,666
给朋友发一句今天有点累
texting a friend that you are a bit tired today

250
00:06:22,833 --> 00:06:23,966
这些事不酷
these things are not cool

251
00:06:23,966 --> 00:06:25,000
也不刺激
nor exciting

252
00:06:25,033 --> 00:06:27,366
但它们不会把情绪变成账单
but they do not turn emotions into bills

253
00:06:27,766 --> 00:06:29,566
你要允许自己被安慰
Let yourself be comforted

254
00:06:29,700 --> 00:06:31,866
但别让每一次安慰都收费
but do not let every comfort charge you

255
00:06:32,266 --> 00:06:33,066
第四
Fourth

256
00:06:33,133 --> 00:06:35,566
给自己一个不花钱的奖励清单
make yourself a free reward list

257
00:06:35,866 --> 00:06:37,566
很多人一说奖励自己
many people when they say reward myself

258
00:06:37,833 --> 00:06:39,666
脑子里马上出现买东西
immediately picture buying something

259
00:06:40,100 --> 00:06:41,700
其实奖励可以很便宜
but rewards can be cheap

260
00:06:42,100 --> 00:06:43,500
比如今晚不加班
like no overtime tonight

261
00:06:43,533 --> 00:06:45,400
比如把手机放远一点
like keeping the phone a bit away

262
00:06:45,666 --> 00:06:47,400
比如看一集喜欢的剧
like watching an episode you love

263
00:06:47,700 --> 00:06:50,300
比如把明早的闹钟调晚十分钟
like setting tomorrow's alarm ten minutes later

264
00:06:50,533 --> 00:06:52,433
比如给自己煮一碗热汤
like cooking yourself a bowl of warm soup

265
00:06:52,833 --> 00:06:54,566
这些奖励不够刺激
these rewards are not thrilling

266
00:06:54,700 --> 00:06:56,233
但它们更像照顾
but they feel more like care

267
00:06:56,566 --> 00:06:58,766
消费给你的常常是兴奋
spending usually gives you excitement

268
00:06:58,966 --> 00:07:00,900
照顾给你的才是恢复
care is what gives you recovery

269
00:07:01,233 --> 00:07:03,000
你越能分清这两者
the better you tell them apart

270
00:07:03,066 --> 00:07:06,100
越不容易把每一次疲惫都送进购物车
the less you send every bout of fatigue into the cart

271
00:07:06,566 --> 00:07:08,466
深夜最适合做的决定
The best decision to make late at night

272
00:07:08,733 --> 00:07:09,733
不是付款
is not to pay

273
00:07:09,733 --> 00:07:10,666
是暂停
it is to pause

274
00:07:11,166 --> 00:07:13,400
真正贵的不是那件商品
What is truly expensive is not that item

275
00:07:13,666 --> 00:07:16,666
是你越来越习惯用钱替自己止痛
it is your growing habit of numbing pain with money

276
00:07:17,233 --> 00:07:19,233
还有一个更简单的办法
There is an even simpler way

277
00:07:19,566 --> 00:07:22,300
把深夜想买的东西写成一句话
write what you want to buy into one sentence

278
00:07:22,700 --> 00:07:23,900
我想买这个
I want to buy this

279
00:07:24,133 --> 00:07:26,566
因为我希望自己看起来更好
because I want to look better

280
00:07:26,900 --> 00:07:28,166
我想买这个
I want to buy this

281
00:07:28,300 --> 00:07:30,166
因为我今天太累了
because I am too tired today

282
00:07:30,500 --> 00:07:31,766
我想买这个
I want to buy this

283
00:07:31,866 --> 00:07:34,433
因为我不想承认自己有点孤独
because I do not want to admit I am a little lonely

284
00:07:34,866 --> 00:07:35,966
你一写出来
Once you write it down

285
00:07:36,033 --> 00:07:38,800
很多订单就会露出真正的名字
many orders reveal their real names

286
00:07:39,133 --> 00:07:40,366
它不叫杯子
it is not called a cup

287
00:07:40,466 --> 00:07:42,033
叫想重新开始
it is called wanting a fresh start

288
00:07:42,300 --> 00:07:43,466
它不叫衣服
it is not called clothes

289
00:07:43,533 --> 00:07:44,833
叫想被看见
it is called wanting to be seen

290
00:07:45,133 --> 00:07:46,300
它不叫零食
it is not called a snack

291
00:07:46,500 --> 00:07:48,366
叫今天没人安慰我
it is called no one comforted me today

292
00:07:48,666 --> 00:07:50,466
当你能说出它的真名
When you can say its real name

293
00:07:50,666 --> 00:07:53,300
你就不一定非要用付款解决它
you no longer have to solve it by paying

294
00:07:53,666 --> 00:07:55,666
有些欲望只要被看见
some desires once seen

295
00:07:55,833 --> 00:07:57,066
就会安静一点
grow a little quieter

296
00:07:57,366 --> 00:07:59,400
有些委屈只要被承认
some grievances once acknowledged

297
00:07:59,566 --> 00:08:01,466
就不会急着变成快递
no longer rush to become a delivery

298
00:08:01,833 --> 00:08:04,166
所以深夜购物真正要练的
So what late night shopping really trains

299
00:08:04,233 --> 00:08:05,200
不是忍住
is not holding back

300
00:08:05,300 --> 00:08:06,566
而是听懂自己
but understanding yourself

301
00:08:06,966 --> 00:08:08,000
听懂以后
once you understand

302
00:08:08,133 --> 00:08:09,800
你可以明天再决定
you can decide tomorrow

303
00:08:10,033 --> 00:08:12,433
你也可以换一种方式照顾自己
you can care for yourself another way

304
00:08:12,766 --> 00:08:14,700
你甚至可以什么都不做
you can even do nothing

305
00:08:14,900 --> 00:08:16,066
只是早点睡
just go to bed early

306
00:08:16,366 --> 00:08:17,233
很多时候
many times

307
00:08:17,533 --> 00:08:19,033
第二天醒来的你
the you who wakes up tomorrow

308
00:08:19,166 --> 00:08:22,066
会感谢昨晚那个没有立刻付款的自己
will thank the you who did not pay last night

309
00:08:22,533 --> 00:08:25,600
那是一种更便宜也更干净的自由
that is a cheaper and cleaner kind of freedom

310
00:08:25,766 --> 00:08:28,033
也更像真正的自我照顾
and more like real self care

311
00:08:28,133 --> 00:08:29,700
深夜下单不是罪
Late night buying is not a sin

312
00:08:29,966 --> 00:08:31,300
它只是一个提醒
it is just a reminder

313
00:08:31,533 --> 00:08:33,466
提醒你白天过得太紧
reminding you your day was too tight

314
00:08:33,666 --> 00:08:36,166
提醒你太久没有好好照顾自己
reminding you it has been too long since you cared for yourself

315
00:08:36,500 --> 00:08:39,600
提醒你需要的可能不是更多商品
reminding you that you may not need more goods

316
00:08:39,766 --> 00:08:42,366
而是更多能让自己喘气的地方
but more room to breathe

317
00:08:42,633 --> 00:08:44,500
一个人最该拿回来的
What one should reclaim most

318
00:08:44,500 --> 00:08:46,466
不是绝对不消费的自律
is not the discipline of never spending

319
00:08:46,666 --> 00:08:49,566
而是看见自己真正需要什么的清醒
but the clarity to see what you truly need

320
00:08:49,700 --> 00:08:51,500
下一期我们聊外卖
Next time we will talk about takeout

321
00:08:51,666 --> 00:08:53,433
为什么外卖越来越贵
why takeout keeps getting more expensive

322
00:08:53,900 --> 00:08:55,833
不一定只是商家变坏
it is not always that sellers turned bad

323
00:08:56,333 --> 00:08:57,100
很多时候
many times

324
00:08:57,100 --> 00:08:58,600
你买的不是一顿饭
what you buy is not a meal

325
00:08:58,733 --> 00:09:01,000
而是别人替你省掉的麻烦
but the trouble someone saved you from

326
00:09:01,233 --> 00:09:02,300
我们下期见
See you next time
